      "side": 1,
      "message": "In case of matching carrier information, carrier id should be used by default instead of mcc, mnc, numeric or mvno etc.\n         \nhttps://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:frameworks/base/core/java/android/provider/Telephony.java;l\u003d3466;drc\u003d8dfd569c1ecd86d4c1a80f423c83dbc03e1b6f1f\n\nAnd mvno fields have been deprecated from APN.\n\nCould you describe more about the case that the sim changes carrier id?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 12,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 13,
        "endChar": 42
      },
      "revId": "8ce44eb043cf209863fda686b56dedcc6482e41b",
